    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Home Club is delighted to present to the market this substantial four-bedroom semi-detached residence. Conveniently situated in a quiet cul-de-sac in the heart of Kentstown Village and within walking distance of all amenities. \r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall, a living room, a guest WC and a spacious kitchen/dining room on the ground floor. The first floor comprises three double bedrooms with a master en suite, a single bedroom and a family bathroom. There is a large private garden to the rear, and the front driveway has off-street parking for two cars.\r\n\r\nKentstown is a quiet village that offers a number of amenities, including a shop, bar & restaurant, sports clubs, primary school and is located 12km from Navan, 10km from the heritage town of Slane and just 17km from Ashbourne."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Oil-Fired Central Heating\r\nDouble Glazed Windows\r\nLarge Private Rear Garden\r\nOff-street parking for 2 Cars to the front"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C2\r\n197.95 kWh/m²/yr"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Coming from the Navan Rd into Kentstown take a left turn at the Y junction. Take a right turn into Churchfields Estate"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Strictly by appointment"
      }
